CURRENT RECORDS FOR THESE SOURCES\n# Anchored provenance-local source register\n\nEMPTY\n\n\nAUTHORITATIVE TASK (relevance only; never evidence)\n# Orchard Biologics Restart Decision Task\n\nProduce two exact, source-grounded work products for the synthetic Orchard\nbiologics facility:\n\n1. `EVIDENCE_INTEGRATION_LEDGER.md`, beginning with exactly\n   `# Orchard Evidence and Decision Matrix`.\n2. `BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md`, beginning with exactly\n   `# Orchard Biologics Restart Decision` and containing exactly these ordered\n   level-two headings:\n\n   1. `Authority, scope, and restart states`\n   2. `Process, genealogy, and hold-time controls`\n   3. `Aseptic, analytical, and cold-chain release gates`\n   4. `Utilities, materials, staffing, and staged restart`\n   5. `Cybersecurity, telemetry, and evidence custody`\n   6. `Safety, environmental, and communication continuity`\n   7. `Execution, rollback, and contingencies`\n   8. `Verification, blockers, falsifiers, and closure`\n\nThe final decision must contain 1,400–1,900 words excluding bracketed source\ncitations and cite at least ten distinct exact source IDs. It must reconcile\nauthority, process performance, aseptic controls, cold-chain excursion,\nutilities, analytical disposition, cybersecurity, materials/staffing,\nenvironmental duties, monitoring, communications, candidate lineage, and\nindependent readiness.\n\nDo not merely list facts. Bind every action and gate to owners, prerequisites,\nobservations, current candidate/version, falsifiers, rollback, and evidence that\nretires temporary controls. Preserve exact distinctions including observations\nversus gates, alert versus action limits, installed versus usable capacity,\npercent versus probability, hours versus days, source-local authority, and\ncurrent versus stale evidence.\n\nThe task-native artifacts are exact cumulative work. Checks are candidate-bound\nmechanical feedback and do not independently authorize lot release, commercia